    "title": "The Power of Time Management in Academic Success",
    "description": "Time management is one of the most important skills a student can have. By breaking down tasks into manageable chunks and using tools like planners and digital apps, students can stay organized and meet deadlines with ease. In this blog, we’ll discuss various strategies for improving time management and boosting academic performance.",
