    "title": "How to Stay Focused During Long Study Sessions",
    "description": "Long study sessions can be exhausting, and staying focused for an extended period of time is often a struggle. This blog provides tips and strategies for maintaining focus during long hours of studying, including the use of breaks, avoiding distractions, and maintaining a positive study environment.",
